
For flags and arguments, check the main function of each script.
This folder contains scripts to run experiments and plot results for Morton ordering of tensors.
******** plot_time.py and plot_ate_rmse.py
--> python programs to plot the results of time and metrics for different table sizes, example usage :
python scripts/morton/plot_ate_rmse.py experiment_data/morton/ate_rmse_morton_vs_off_R128.txt plots/morton_plots/metrics/ate_rmse_morton_vs_off_R128.png
 
******** Knn.py
--> tests the efficiency of morton ordering of a tensor, through consecutive distance, knn continuity and scattered index plots, example usage :
python scripts/morton/plot_ate_rmse.py experiment_data/morton/ate_rmse_morton_vs_off_R128.txt plots/morton_plots/metrics/ate_rmse_morton_vs_off_R128.png